{
  "quest.28BF66D1B8CD4D44.title": "&cBlood &dBrooms",
  "quest.63AE4568375DD1BF.quest_subtitle": "Your Own Environmental Accumulator",
  "quest.0BB0DF36B079558F.title": "&6Blood Linking",
  "quest.2CB69634F6A6E53E.quest_desc": [
    "You'll sometimes find a simple &9Dark Temple&r structure in your world with a beam of light coming off of it, high into the skies.",
    "",
    "In the middle of the &9Dark Temple&r you'll find an &aEnvironmental Accumulator&r, which you can use to empower and make several items in the &eEvilCraft&r mod.",
    "",
    "Throwing a &3Weather Container&r into the &aEnvironmental Accumulator&r during rain or a thunderstorm will allow you to harness their powers to control the weather at will.",
  ],
  "quest.2CB69634F6A6E53E.title": "Dark Temples",
  "quest.525517F1625A9BCB.title": "Automating Blood Collection",
  "quest.5A8F4CA0F09F4842.quest_desc": [
    "The &dPurifier&r allows you to remove &5Enchantments&r and &cCurses&r from items using blood.",
    "",
    "You'll need at least 1 bucket's worth of blood in the &dPurifier&r, then throw in the item you want to remove an enchantment from and a &cBlook&r to absorb one of the enchants from the item.",
  ],
  "quest.68318811CCC28320.quest_desc": [
    "To progress further into &eEvilCraft&r, you'll need to create &3Blood Infusion Cores&r, which are one of the mod's main crafting components.",
    "",
    "To craft your first &2Dark Power Gem&r, collect at least 5 buckets of blood, then toss a &aDark Gem&r into a hole containing at least 5 blocks of blood to infuse it.",
    "",
    "To get &cHardened Blood&r, you can either let blood dry by placing it in-world or in a &2Drying Basin&r. Breaking it with a &aFlint and Steel&r will get you &dBlood Shards&r.",
  ],
  "task.241552F6DE892E6A.title": "Promise Upgrades",
  "quest.62A262A706CFCAF0.quest_desc": [
    "The &cBlood Infuser&r is the main machine of &eEvilCraft&r that infuses items with blood.",
    "",
    "You can now use this to make &3Dark Power Gems&r instead.",
    "",
    "The &cBlood Infuser&r can be upgraded using &bPromises&r, which will be covered in the next few quests.",
  ],
  "quest.59036A2741E7A8AA.quest_desc": [
    "The &9Spirit Reanimator&r allows you to use your trapped spirit to create a spawn egg.",
    "",
    "It'll require quite a lot of &cBlood&r, an Egg, and a &dBox of Eternal Closure&r with your chosen Spirit.",
    "",
    "&7&oNot all mob Spawn Eggs can be created this way",
  ],
  "quest.4EBED8ABC8C863A4.quest_desc": [
    "You can now use your &cBlood Infuser&r to craft the final upgrade tier of the mod, the &bPromise of Tenacity III&r.",
    "",
    "This unlocks all remaining recipes and items in &eEvilCraft&r.",
  ],
  "quest.066438B01655D866.quest_desc": [
    "Using the &dVengeance Focus&r, you can freeze a Spirit in place, allowing you to capture them by placing a &3Box of Eternal Closure&r close to it.",
  ],
  "quest.7B524DAD8A33BF85.title": "Useful Tools",
  "quest.62A262A706CFCAF0.title": "The &cBlood Infuser",
  "quest.1DA0A87C471A38AC.title": "Blood-made Mob Farms",
  "quest.28BF66D1B8CD4D44.quest_subtitle": "Broom Broom",
  "quest.35FA55BE8DF49EE8.title": "Garmonbozia",
  "quest.35FA55BE8DF49EE8.quest_desc": [
    "Using a &dVengeance Spirit's &bEssence&r, you can create &6Garmonbozia&r in the &cBlood Infuser&r.",
    "",
    "This is one of the main ingredients used in advanced &eEvilCraft&r recipes.",
  ],
  "quest.63AE4568375DD1BF.quest_desc": [
    "Using &6Garmonbozia&r, you can now craft your own &aEnvironmental Accumulator&r.",
  ],
  "quest.51B24CC5E9332C1E.quest_desc": [
    "Sometimes, killing a mob will spawn a &dVengeance Spirit&r. You'll need to capture these spirits to make more advanced items (see next quest).",
    "",
    "For now, if you're struggling to find these Spirits, a &2Vengeance Ring&r can help you attract them.",
  ],
  "quest.63AE4568375DD1BF.title": "Sanguinary Environmental Accumulator",
  "quest.7E79F52147B606F9.quest_desc": [
    "To start collecting blood, you'll need to craft a &cBlood Extractor&r and start killing mobs.",
    "",
    "It'll automatically collect blood as you kill mobs and its blood capacity can be increased, so check JEI once it starts filling up.",
    "",
    "You can also use these to extract blood directly from &cBlood Stains&r on the ground.",
  ],
  "quest.31FD9EA513E0D010.title": "Welcome to &eEvilCraft&r!",
  "quest.0BB0DF36B079558F.quest_desc": [
    "An &6Entangled Chalice&r can be used to supply blood to items in your inventory.",
    "",
    "To do this, simply place one in the world and provide it with &cBlood&r. Then activate the one in your inventory.",
    "",
    "If you want to use more than 2 &6Chalices&r in the same network, just use the alternate crafting recipe that uses a Chalice instead of a Gold Ingot in the center of the recipe.",
  ],
  "quest.40888A2C17D8FFF6.quest_desc": [
    "With the &cBlood Infuser&r, you can now make &cUndead Saplings&r.",
    "",
    "The wood from these trees is useful for creating several tools and items within &eEvilCraft&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4978A9B616362CCE.title": "&aRank 2&r: More &cBlood",
  "quest.62CE0FFAF6352287.quest_desc": [
    "&eEvilCraft&r machines can be upgraded using &bPromises&r, each with different effects.",
    "",
    "Start by crafting the &bPromise of Tenacity I&r. This increases the storage capacity of a machine and unlocks more &cBlood Infuser&r recipes.",
    "",
    "You can also upgrade your machines with the &aPromise of Productivity&r or the &2Promise of Velocity&r, which increase the Efficiency and Speed of your machines.",
  ],
  "quest.6B7C016407F7AE3C.quest_desc": [
    "As you've seen, normal weapons cannot damage &dVengeance Spirits&r. Craft and shoot a &6Piercing Vengeance Beam&r at them to kill them.",
    "",
    "This will drop their &aEssence&r which is used for more advanced recipes.",
  ],
  "quest.68318811CCC28320.title": "&aInfusion Cores",
  "quest.7B524DAD8A33BF85.quest_desc": [
    "The &3Vein Sword&r collects more blood from slaying mobs and comes with the &bLooting II&r enchantment.",
    "",
    "The &3Vengeance Pickaxe&r comes with Fortune V, but may summon vengeful spirits while you are mining.",
  ],
  "quest.4EBED8ABC8C863A4.title": "&aRank 3&r: Even More &cBlood",
  "quest.6B7C016407F7AE3C.quest_subtitle": "Killing Vengeance Spirits",
  "quest.525517F1625A9BCB.quest_desc": [
    "If you're looking to automate blood using your mob farm, simply place a &2Spiked Plate&r on top of a &aSanguinary Pedestal&r and have your mobs stand or drop on it.",
  ],
  "quest.51B24CC5E9332C1E.title": "Revenge of the &dSpirits",
  "quest.066438B01655D866.title": "Capturing &dSpirits",
  "quest.600F66B13B29708B.quest_desc": [
    "The &zRejuvenated Flesh&r grants you an infinite food source that consumes blood.",
    "",
    "&3Humanoid Flesh&r drops when a player dies, and &dWerewolf Flesh&r can be found in villages.",
  ],
  "quest.5A8F4CA0F09F4842.title": "Item Cleansing",
  "quest.28BF66D1B8CD4D44.quest_desc": [
    "&dBrooms&r are made using three separate parts, a Rod, a Cap, and a Brush.",
    "",
    "Each part is crafted by combining it with other items that modify that part. Check the &6Origin of Darkness&r guidebook for a full list.",
    "",
    "Once you have your parts, simply place each part into a crafting table to put together your &dBroom&r, which will require &cBlood&r to function.",
  ],
  "quest.4D7B6842B9F53459.quest_desc": [
    "The &dEffortless Ring&r grants speed and jump boost and step height when in your inventory or equipped to a Ring slot.",
  ],
  "quest.7E79F52147B606F9.title": "Collecting &cBlood",
  "quest.40888A2C17D8FFF6.title": "Undead Trees",
  "quest.4978A9B616362CCE.quest_desc": [
    "With access to more recipes, your &cBlood Infuser&r can now be used to craft the &bPromise of Tenacity II&r.",
    "",
    "This unlocks even more recipes, further increases the machine's blood capacity, and grants access to the &dSpirit Furnace&r used to create your own mob farms.",
  ],
  "task.7DE03D4A420D1028.title": "&eFind&r: &aDark Temple",
  "quest.59036A2741E7A8AA.title": "&aCreating &9Spawn Eggs",
  "quest.62CE0FFAF6352287.title": "&aUpgrading Machines",
  "quest.31FD9EA513E0D010.quest_desc": [
    "&eEvilCraft&r is a magic mod based around gathering blood from mobs.",
    "",
    "To get started, go mining for some &aDark Gems&r.",
  ],
  "quest.1DA0A87C471A38AC.quest_desc": [
    "To start your own &eEvilCraft&r mob farm, you'll need at least 33 &aDark Blood Bricks&r to build the structure for the summoned spirits and a &9Box of Eternal Closure&r with your chosen spirit.",
    "",
    "The structure itself should have enough room for the mob to spawn, so the minimum size is a 3x4x3 for mobs like Zombies.",
    "",
    "Also be sure to place a &dSpirit Furnace&r on one of its faces to interact with the structure.",
    "",
    "Bigger mobs like Ghasts and Endermen will need bigger structures.",
  ],
}